{
  "format_version": 2,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "chapter": "street",
  "conversations": {
    "street_arrival": {
      "default_source": "observed",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "s_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "s_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "一到街上，就想起书还没拿。又一想，没找到的东西也不能算忘拿。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "street_arrived",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "set_objective",
              "key": "objective.outside"
            },
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "street_outside",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "出了校门。回头看，单凭窗子认不出刚才那间教室。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "你转头认了一下墙。从这一面，教室的窗和别的窗没两样。"
        },
        {
          "id": "s_3",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "路对面还有一排楼。沿人行道走，看看哪儿能过去。",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "street_wall": {
      "default_source": "observed",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "w_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "w_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "瓷砖铺到窗底，齐齐地断了。再往上数，才是你坐着听课的高度。"
        },
        {
          "id": "w_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "摄像头不对着门，偏偏对着墙根那撮草。守在那儿的人大概连下课也看不出来。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "street_camera",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "校墙上的摄像头对着草地，不对着门。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "w_3",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "真要回来，窗户是一扇也指望不上的。",
          "next": "w_tab_glass"
        },
        {
          "id": "w_tab_glass",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "你把签留给了玻璃门。沿墙走到玻璃那儿就行；到门跟前，再看里面是哪一层。",
          "next": "w_tab_stair",
          "source": "recalled",
          "conditions": {
            "requires": {
              "corridor_directory_tab": "glass"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "w_tab_stair",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "你把签留给了楼梯。街上的台阶不是那一截。得先进门，才用得上那个记号。",
          "next": null,
          "source": "recalled",
          "conditions": {
            "requires": {
              "corridor_directory_tab": "stair"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "street_notice": {
      "default_source": "observed",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "n_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "n_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "纸下面还有一张。最上面这张翘起一角，露出半截旧照片。"
        },
        {
          "id": "n_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "找猫。上面那只蹲着，底下只露出一截尾巴。你试着把两张当成同一只看，接不上。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "street_lost_cat",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "电线杆上叠贴了两张找猫的纸，露出的照片对不上。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "n_3",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "最清楚的倒是底下那张的日期。四年前。外面这圈胶还黏手。",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
